## Summary by Sourcery

Refactor the file upload functionality to support multiple file types and introduce a new text splitting utility. Replace the useTextFileUpload hook with a more versatile useFileUpload hook that supports text, wav, and mp3 file uploads. Add a textSplitter utility to handle splitting text into lines based on newline characters.

New Features:
- Introduce a new textSplitter utility to split long strings into an array of lines based on newline characters.

Bug Fixes:
- Fix file uploader to support multiple file types including wav, mp3, and txt.

Enhancements:
- Refactor file upload hook to use a more generic useFileUpload hook, replacing the previous useTextFileUpload.

